# Porkbun Provider

Manage [Porkbun](https://porkbun.com) domains from Terraform.

The reason this provider exists is `porkbun_domain_nameservers`. If your
domains are registered at Porkbun but their zones live somewhere else — Cloud
DNS, Route 53, anywhere — the delegation is the one piece that otherwise has
to be clicked through the Porkbun web UI on every change.

Nameservers are modelled as a **set**, and compared ignoring case, trailing
dots and ordering, so another provider's `name_servers` output can be passed
straight through. An NS RRset is unordered (RFC 1034/2181) and registries
return it in whatever order they like.

